# web/kb/markers.json is a GENERATED artifact (tools/export_markers_kb.py
# writes it with LF) and tests/test_markers_kb_export.py asserts a fresh
# export matches the committed file BYTE FOR BYTE, per repo lesson 40. With
# no .gitattributes, Windows checkouts under core.autocrlf=true silently
# rewrite it to CRLF on checkout, failing that test for a reason that has
# nothing to do with markers.py -- force LF so the byte comparison is stable
# on every platform.
web/kb/*.json text eol=lf
